WEBVTT

01:41.000 --> 01:41.620
STRATEGY MEETING

01:41.620 --> 01:44.670
STRATEGY MEETING
Just when we thought damage
to the city would be inevitable

01:44.670 --> 01:45.460
STRATEGY MEETING
a powerful attack pulverized
that giant creature.

01:45.460 --> 01:48.090
a powerful attack pulverized
that giant creature.

01:48.300 --> 01:52.260
So you're saying Centichoro
disappeared without a trace?

01:52.930 --> 01:57.140
It's hard to believe, but this is
a feat only King could pull off.

01:57.350 --> 02:00.180
We are incredibly lucky to
have King as our ally.

02:00.270 --> 02:05.310
As for the Hero Hunter, I hear
Silverfang failed to capture him.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.650
What do you plan to do
about this, Sitch?

02:07.940 --> 02:09.690
If he continues to
hunt heroes like this

02:09.690 --> 02:12.280
the Hero Association
will cease to function.

02:13.240 --> 02:18.080
You must no longer view Garou
as a human, but as a monster.

02:18.330 --> 02:20.200
The next time he appears...

02:20.500 --> 02:22.330
He will be categorized as
threat level Dragon

02:22.330 --> 02:24.620
and an emergency alert
must be issued.

02:25.040 --> 02:27.290
But in reality,
he's still a human, right?

02:27.960 --> 02:29.380
Could any normal person actually

02:29.380 --> 02:31.970
stand up to our Class-S heroes
barehanded?

02:32.090 --> 02:33.420
Just think about it.

02:33.930 --> 02:35.590
Maybe the strategy's the problem?

02:35.890 --> 02:37.180
<i>"Our" Class-S heroes?</i>

02:37.300 --> 02:38.350
<i>Even at this stage</i>

02:38.350 --> 02:40.140
<i>he is treating this</i>
<i>as some kind of business.</i>

02:40.810 --> 02:45.100
It was unexpected that Silverfang
failed to finish off Garou

02:45.100 --> 02:47.730
but he did manage to
leave him severely injured.

02:48.150 --> 02:51.070
At least this means
Garou likely won't bolster

02:51.070 --> 02:52.780
the Monster Association's forces.

02:52.990 --> 02:55.280
If nothing else,
we can count that as a win.

02:55.490 --> 02:57.530
Get Blast over here!
Blast, I say!

02:57.820 --> 03:00.450
He's a top-ranker, but he's
not doing anything at all, is he?

03:00.740 --> 03:03.830
It's impossible
to give Blast orders.

03:04.000 --> 03:08.040
He only operates
as a hero voluntarily.

03:08.710 --> 03:12.420
He refuses to be bound by anyone
and dislikes drawing attention

03:12.420 --> 03:15.050
so even in the registry,
his identity is undisclosed.

03:15.590 --> 03:20.470
But that's because we believe he's
worthy of this special treatment.

03:20.760 --> 03:24.310
However, if humanity really needs help

03:24.310 --> 03:26.190
I'm sure he'll take action.

03:26.270 --> 03:27.850
What do you mean?!

03:28.190 --> 03:32.360
That time is now!
A monster abducted my son!

03:33.030 --> 03:35.400
It's been 24 hours since then.

03:35.450 --> 03:37.700
Why haven't you attacked?

03:37.950 --> 03:40.410
I give you my word.
We will save your son.

03:41.160 --> 03:41.990
And you are...?

03:42.490 --> 03:45.330
I'll be commanding
this rescue operation.

03:45.620 --> 03:47.290
My name is Sekingal.

03:47.920 --> 03:49.630
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

03:50.340 --> 03:51.210
Huh?

03:51.880 --> 03:53.960
What operation?

03:54.260 --> 03:58.300
I'll just sweep in and
take care of things in no time.

03:58.590 --> 04:00.350
Do we know where the hideout is?

04:00.800 --> 04:03.640
Child Emperor is working
at full speed on it right now.

04:04.430 --> 04:09.270
I have surveillance robots probing
Centichoro's underground route.

04:09.690 --> 04:12.940
But the area is huge...
we have three days, right?

04:12.940 --> 04:14.030
We only have two days left.

04:14.360 --> 04:16.440
Ugh...
No sleep for me!

04:16.740 --> 04:20.490
The hideout is somewhere
in City Z's ghost town, right?

04:20.700 --> 04:22.870
KABOOM
Shall I just wipe it out?

04:22.870 --> 04:22.990
KABOOM

04:22.990 --> 04:26.000
KABOOM
We must tread carefully
since there is a hostage.

04:26.330 --> 04:28.580
Sounds like a pain in the neck.

04:28.750 --> 04:31.630
If they hadn't done that
they'd have no chance against me.

04:32.130 --> 04:34.500
The monsters must be afraid of me.

04:34.750 --> 04:36.590
The opponents
are pretty formidable.

04:36.590 --> 04:38.010
Yeah, whatever.

04:38.380 --> 04:42.010
Did you call us here just
to give us that warning?

04:44.600 --> 04:45.560
Actually yesterday...

04:45.770 --> 04:48.310
Drive Knight forcibly continued
the investigation on his own.

04:48.640 --> 04:53.190
He ignored our warnings and
entered the ghost town ahead of us.

04:53.900 --> 04:55.070
Why would he go alone?!

04:55.570 --> 05:00.200
He's never lost a battle,
so he must've been confident.

05:00.700 --> 05:01.910
But since last night

05:01.910 --> 05:04.990
we haven't been able to pick up
a signal from his transmitter.

05:05.830 --> 05:09.620
I think it's safe to assume that
Drive Knight has been defeated.

05:11.290 --> 05:12.830
I don't care either way.

05:12.830 --> 05:15.630
You'd better hurry up and
assemble your team.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.170
Who's left?

05:17.800 --> 05:21.840
The Monster Association gave us
a three-day ultimatum.

05:22.050 --> 05:23.220
We still have time.

05:24.430 --> 05:28.640
As soon as the other heroes
are ready, they will rush over too.

05:30.020 --> 05:32.400
Still on standby?
What's going on?

05:33.060 --> 05:35.190
A child is being held hostage?

05:35.570 --> 05:38.150
You didn't know about that,
Atomic Samurai?

05:38.480 --> 05:40.610
You also reek of blood.

05:41.320 --> 05:44.570
Since yesterday, I've been
scouring mountains and caves

05:44.570 --> 05:49.160
looking for hidden monsters and
slashing 'em up, left, and right.

05:50.000 --> 05:51.830
Unfortunately,
I wasn't able to find

05:51.830 --> 05:53.880
the Monster Association's
hideout though.

05:54.380 --> 05:55.460
Yeah, makes sense.

05:55.670 --> 05:59.130
I hear the Monster Association's
hideout is in the ghost town.

05:59.380 --> 06:01.670
What?!
We know that much?

06:02.260 --> 06:05.680
Well, fighting head-on at
the hideout sounds easy enough.

06:06.350 --> 06:08.640
I suggest we all
get some rest till then.

06:08.770 --> 06:11.100
- Okay.
- I'm going to take a shower.

06:13.020 --> 06:13.850
Oh my!

06:14.560 --> 06:18.020
I heard the assault team would
be made up of an elite few, but...

06:18.520 --> 06:21.440
For some reason, there are
some here who don't fit the bill.

06:21.990 --> 06:23.400
This is not a picnic.

06:23.910 --> 06:28.240
How about we refrain from bringing
our fun friends, Atomic Samurai?

06:29.370 --> 06:31.910
I'd like the small fry to stick
to fighting other small fry.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.210
You got that?

06:33.540 --> 06:35.960
It wouldn't be so bad
if they just die

06:35.960 --> 06:38.420
but what if they're taken as
hostages or used as human shields?

06:38.750 --> 06:40.460
That would be a major hassle.

06:41.050 --> 06:42.630
If that ever happens

06:42.630 --> 06:45.300
can you give them the orders
to commit harakiri?

06:45.430 --> 06:47.300
Hey, take it easy, Mr. Handsome...

06:47.390 --> 06:50.010
Amai Mask, are you on the team?

06:50.520 --> 06:55.690
Of course. Those monsters
interrupted my concert.

06:56.060 --> 07:00.610
I see. My disciples are tough,
you know.

07:00.820 --> 07:04.490
I'll tell them to protect
the pretty boy idol

07:04.490 --> 07:06.700
when he gets in trouble.

07:07.030 --> 07:08.660
So relax.

07:08.990 --> 07:10.200
In trouble?

07:10.700 --> 07:12.160
I can't believe there are people

07:12.160 --> 07:14.750
who still doubt
my combat abilities.

07:15.330 --> 07:18.710
I only stay in Class A because
it's easier to oversee everything.

07:18.710 --> 07:20.670
I can move up to Class S
at any time.

07:21.590 --> 07:23.460
Mm, let's see now.

07:23.880 --> 07:26.220
To put it simply,
so an imbecile can understand...

07:26.760 --> 07:28.220
I'm stronger than you.

07:28.470 --> 07:31.720
Hm? Oh yeah?

07:31.720 --> 07:34.230
<i>Master! Keep your cool!</i>

07:36.140 --> 07:40.980
Warden, you sure I can just walk
right out the front door?

07:41.230 --> 07:43.900
This is an extra-legal measure.

07:44.280 --> 07:45.450
Let me remind you that

07:45.450 --> 07:49.160
every time you've broken
out of prison to do hero work

07:49.160 --> 07:50.870
that's all been illegal activity.

07:51.910 --> 07:53.740
I don't like how
the Hero Association

07:53.740 --> 07:56.210
gives a guy like you
preferential treatment.

07:56.540 --> 07:58.420
But just this once,
I can't afford to say that.

07:59.710 --> 08:03.550
There was a single cat-like monster

08:03.550 --> 08:06.420
who turned some of the prisoners
into monsters and took them away.

08:06.880 --> 08:10.260
Many officers who fought back
lost their lives.

08:10.640 --> 08:12.760
You're a hero out there,
aren't you?

08:12.930 --> 08:14.720
Isn't that right,
boss of the prisoners?

08:15.430 --> 08:18.020
Get revenge for us!

08:18.850 --> 08:20.060
Leave it to me.

08:20.690 --> 08:24.070
I'll make them pay dearly

08:24.070 --> 08:26.070
for wrecking this place
while I was gone.

08:26.990 --> 08:28.610
Hang on, Boss!

08:29.200 --> 08:31.120
I knitted a sweater for you.

08:31.660 --> 08:32.950
Please wear it if you like.

08:37.120 --> 08:40.000
Thank you.
This will give me courage.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.630
Hey.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.880
You mind leaving the room?

08:46.010 --> 08:47.800
I can't focus with
you all staring at me.

08:50.680 --> 08:51.800
Metal Knight.

08:51.930 --> 08:54.680
I know you're pretending
not to be there. Please answer.

08:55.850 --> 08:56.930
<i>What...?</i>

08:57.140 --> 09:00.230
I feel like I'm wasting
a lot of time and effort.

09:02.020 --> 09:04.980
I'm sure you've figured out
where the hideout is by now, right?

09:05.150 --> 09:07.740
Please tell me.
We're running out of time.

09:07.820 --> 09:09.650
Are you going to
let the hostage die?

09:10.700 --> 09:14.030
<i>By not telling you,</i>
<i>the hostage might die.</i>

09:14.200 --> 09:15.540
<i>But if I do tell you</i>

09:15.540 --> 09:19.120
<i>I bring death to not only</i>
<i>the hostage, but to all of you.</i>

09:19.370 --> 09:23.420
<i>I will make a rational choice</i>
<i>based on justice.</i>

09:23.830 --> 09:25.750
There's another option.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.710
You can join the operation.

09:28.340 --> 09:30.680
What are you so afraid of?

09:30.880 --> 09:33.640
What is the state of
your machine body right now?

09:34.100 --> 09:37.520
If it has been destroyed, which
monster did that to you and how?

09:38.980 --> 09:40.890
<i>Monster King Orochi.</i>

09:41.850 --> 09:43.190
<i>It was just one strike.</i>

09:43.350 --> 09:45.150
<i>The arm I used to</i>
<i>guard myself was destroyed.</i>

09:45.150 --> 09:47.360
<i>Even the self-destruction device</i>
<i>was disabled.</i>

09:48.610 --> 09:51.610
<i>It's not the Monster Association</i>
<i>I'm afraid of...</i>

09:52.360 --> 09:53.200
<i>Evil powers are</i>

09:53.200 --> 09:55.580
<i>watching for their chance to</i>
<i>take over the world.</i>

09:55.990 --> 09:58.240
<i>When humanity's defenses</i>
<i>become weak</i>

09:58.240 --> 10:00.250
<i>they'll strike all at once</i>
<i>to take everything.</i>

10:00.660 --> 10:02.370
<i>Be careful.</i>

10:02.620 --> 10:05.130
<i>Don't trust anyone around you.</i>

10:05.590 --> 10:08.250
<i>If you want to enforce justice</i>
<i>do it alone.</i>

10:08.710 --> 10:10.840
<i>Build up your strength...</i>

10:10.840 --> 10:13.050
<i>And save it for the right time,</i>
<i>Child Emperor.</i>

10:18.810 --> 10:21.230
The Hero Association is useless.

10:21.430 --> 10:22.520
Listen up, all of you!

10:22.850 --> 10:24.150
Even as I speak

10:24.150 --> 10:26.520
my son is trembling in fear
as he waits for help.

10:26.940 --> 10:29.230
Head over to the abandoned area
of City Z immediately

10:29.360 --> 10:30.940
and find the Monsters' hideout!

10:31.110 --> 10:32.700
And rescue my son!

10:33.110 --> 10:34.910
The battle suits you are wearing

10:34.910 --> 10:37.070
are secret weapons
obtained from special channels.

10:37.490 --> 10:38.950
The performance of these suits

10:38.990 --> 10:41.830
easily surpass the power
of any professional hero.

10:42.040 --> 10:42.330
NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE

10:42.330 --> 10:44.080
NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE
Make full use of your battle suits

10:44.080 --> 10:44.210
NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE

10:44.210 --> 10:46.170
NARINKI PRIVATE FORCE
and exterminate
every single monster you encounter.

10:46.170 --> 10:46.210
and exterminate
every single monster you encounter.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.880
I'll pay whatever you name
for the success fee!

10:49.170 --> 10:50.840
Bring back Waganma alive

10:50.840 --> 10:52.880
and you will live in
luxury for generations to come!

10:53.010 --> 10:53.970
Go!!

10:59.930 --> 11:03.680
I'm pretty sure
it's that small building.

11:04.640 --> 11:05.900
I got you cornered!

11:07.810 --> 11:10.110
<i>The Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>has been wiped out.</i>

11:10.400 --> 11:12.610
<i>Well, half of it</i>
<i>is my sister's fault.</i>

11:13.570 --> 11:14.990
<i>This is an emergency.</i>

11:15.450 --> 11:17.490
<i>I need to use this place</i>
<i>as a branch office</i>

11:17.490 --> 11:19.410
<i>of the Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>to hold a meeting.</i>

11:20.200 --> 11:21.160
Yes?

11:21.540 --> 11:22.830
Saita...
Wait, who are you?

11:23.370 --> 11:25.410
Oh? A friend?

11:26.000 --> 11:28.380
You have a visitor, Saitama!

11:30.540 --> 11:33.050
Blizzard's here again.

11:33.210 --> 11:35.840
Hey, how come the monster I raised

11:35.930 --> 11:38.180
died right away
with just a single hit of yours?

11:38.550 --> 11:40.350
What do you want, Hellish Blizzard?

11:40.600 --> 11:42.560
Master is not
taking any new disciples.

11:42.680 --> 11:44.180
Sorry, it's so cramped.

11:44.310 --> 11:46.890
Would you hand me that poultice?

11:47.190 --> 11:49.400
Why would wind be earth's weakness?

11:49.520 --> 11:51.980
But I'm at level 27
and you're at level 15, you know.

11:52.230 --> 11:53.650
Even if you're at
the highest level

11:53.730 --> 11:56.280
Old Man Golem can't beat
Meow-Meow types.

11:56.700 --> 11:58.200
It's a weak character
to begin with.

11:58.410 --> 12:00.450
What? You should've
told me that sooner!

12:00.530 --> 12:02.660
- This Armpit character...
- That one's weak too.

12:02.790 --> 12:05.290
Actually, only the cute characters
are strong.

12:05.410 --> 12:07.580
Oh, forget it.
That just ruined it for me.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.380
<i>What is going on?</i>

12:10.250 --> 12:11.880
Hm? Why are you here?

12:12.000 --> 12:13.210
It's an emergency.

12:13.420 --> 12:15.460
The Blizzard Bunch got wiped out!

12:15.630 --> 12:17.840
The Monster Organization is
extremely dangerous.

12:18.090 --> 12:20.050
This is no time
to be playing games.

12:20.050 --> 12:22.470
Do you have any idea
what's going on right now?

12:23.180 --> 12:24.720
You don't need to yell.

12:25.100 --> 12:28.020
I just got home a while ago and
was taking a short break.

12:28.100 --> 12:29.400
Don't lie down!

12:29.600 --> 12:33.440
Just like Master said, we were
also facing some tough opponents.

12:33.860 --> 12:35.480
Don't think you guys
were the only ones.

12:35.690 --> 12:38.990
Yeah, I can tell
from the way you look.

12:39.780 --> 12:41.700
I know King was here before

12:41.740 --> 12:44.700
but what's Silverfang
doing here now?

12:45.290 --> 12:50.330
I fought alongside them,
so Saitama is letting me rest here.

12:50.620 --> 12:52.290
I got a little carried away

12:52.290 --> 12:54.420
threw my back out,
and now I can't move.

12:54.630 --> 12:56.090
My knees gave out.

12:56.300 --> 12:59.430
Using Fist of Roaring Qi, Rending Air
after so long took its toll.

12:59.970 --> 13:03.010
I see, it must have been
quite a battle.

13:03.510 --> 13:07.180
<i>Yet why?</i>
<i>Why is this guy the same as usual?</i>

13:07.560 --> 13:09.730
Hey Saitama!
You're acting all cool and calm

13:09.730 --> 13:11.350
but you're actually panicking, right?

13:11.400 --> 13:13.270
Not really...
it's just the same as usual.

13:13.610 --> 13:14.440
What?

13:14.480 --> 13:16.820
There's no way this situation
is the same as usual!

13:17.320 --> 13:18.940
Why is she getting mad?

13:19.400 --> 13:21.070
I hate to break it to you

13:21.070 --> 13:23.070
but this situation
is not the same as usual.

13:23.490 --> 13:24.370
BAM BAM
Come sit!

13:24.370 --> 13:24.780
Come sit!

13:25.160 --> 13:26.450
We're going to have
a strategy meeting right now!

13:26.450 --> 13:27.540
BAM BAM
We're going to have
a strategy meeting right now!

13:27.580 --> 13:28.870
Seriously, why are you here?

13:29.210 --> 13:31.620
Genos! You're Class S.

13:31.790 --> 13:34.960
The Hero Association executives
haven't told you about their next moves?

13:37.090 --> 13:38.880
I was supporting
Master Saitama yesterday

13:38.880 --> 13:42.050
at a martial arts tournament
and also in a battle myself.

13:42.510 --> 13:44.550
Not to mention,
the transmitter for the Association

13:44.550 --> 13:46.260
got melted and was destroyed.

13:46.350 --> 13:49.430
I dropped mine
into a crack in the ground.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.770
I noticed mine was broken too.

13:51.850 --> 13:54.440
It might have been because of the
shockwaves from Saitama's punch.

13:54.690 --> 13:56.230
So what's our next move?

13:56.270 --> 13:58.730
We're on the brink of war
with the monsters.

13:59.030 --> 14:00.990
I need to undergo
some repairs first.

14:01.200 --> 14:03.070
Well, obviously.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.870
We're gonna need time to recover

14:04.870 --> 14:07.280
before we can
get back into action again.

14:07.370 --> 14:08.870
You can't beat age.

14:09.450 --> 14:10.290
What about you, King?

14:10.290 --> 14:13.120
I think there's some other business
I have to tend to...

14:13.540 --> 14:16.500
So Saitama and I are the only ones
who are ready to go.

14:17.290 --> 14:18.590
So what do you say?

14:18.840 --> 14:21.010
Headquarters probably
has its own special task force

14:21.010 --> 14:22.800
that's devising a plan.

14:23.340 --> 14:26.720
But at times like this, actions
taken by Class-B heroes and below

14:26.720 --> 14:28.890
can affect their future evaluation.

14:29.220 --> 14:31.310
So we should try to
do something to contribute.

14:31.390 --> 14:31.850
DAZE

14:31.850 --> 14:32.810
DAZE
Are you listening?

14:33.520 --> 14:34.850
This time, the enemy is

14:34.850 --> 14:37.230
a large group of monsters
that usually act independently

14:37.230 --> 14:39.690
but they have formed an alliance
which is unusual.

14:40.570 --> 14:43.570
However, their organizational structure

14:43.570 --> 14:46.030
likely is more about domination
than cooperation

14:46.030 --> 14:48.330
with a boss giving orders.

14:48.580 --> 14:51.120
Right, a monster group.

14:51.580 --> 14:55.170
If Garou's joined up with them,
that's gonna be trouble.

14:55.330 --> 15:00.000
Yeah, we may never get another
chance to fight Garou alone.

15:00.170 --> 15:01.760
If they still have any monsters

15:01.760 --> 15:04.510
as strong as that centipede
on their side

15:04.510 --> 15:05.470
it's not looking good.

15:05.590 --> 15:07.890
Might as well quit
being a hero, Bang.

15:08.220 --> 15:09.180
Saitama.

15:09.430 --> 15:11.720
Looks like the Hero Hunter
you've been wanting to meet

15:11.720 --> 15:12.810
was at that scene.

15:12.980 --> 15:14.730
You just missed him.

15:15.190 --> 15:19.020
On my way home, I heard that
he hunted down more heroes.

15:21.400 --> 15:22.400
That's unforgivable.

15:22.650 --> 15:25.280
Especially since
he hasn't come for me yet.

15:25.450 --> 15:26.820
Is it because I'm the Caped Baldy?

15:28.240 --> 15:29.830
- Saitama?
- Master?

15:29.950 --> 15:31.040
I'm going out for a bit.

15:31.950 --> 15:33.660
Do you know where Garou is?

15:34.040 --> 15:35.160
I'm gonna look for him.

15:36.040 --> 15:38.580
When I find Garou, I'll punch him.

15:40.210 --> 15:41.920
I'll also buy
napa cabbage on the way back.

15:45.720 --> 15:48.890
<i>Here I was calling the shots,</i>
<i>but I'm left out in the cold again...</i>

15:49.470 --> 15:51.510
<i>Trying to get Saitama</i>
<i>and his crew</i>

15:51.510 --> 15:53.470
<i>to join the Blizzard Bunch</i>
<i>will not be easy.</i>

16:06.570 --> 16:09.570
<i>Where am I?</i>
<i>Did I survive?</i>

16:09.820 --> 16:11.280
<i>My memory is a bit fuzzy.</i>

16:12.490 --> 16:14.540
<i>Welcome to the Monster Association.</i>

16:14.910 --> 16:18.870
<i>The fact that you are reading this</i>
<i>means you survived.</i>

16:19.500 --> 16:23.300
<i>Be aware that we are the ones</i>
<i>who saved your life.</i>

16:23.500 --> 16:27.300
<i>So wait quietly in this room</i>
<i>without causing any trouble.</i>

16:27.630 --> 16:30.840
<i>Going outside right now will only</i>
<i>make you a target for heroes.</i>

16:31.140 --> 16:32.970
<i>What you need is a place to belong.</i>

16:33.140 --> 16:36.270
<i>There's a change of clothes.</i>
<i>Please feel free to use them.</i>

16:38.270 --> 16:42.150
<i>Oww... It hurts like hell!!</i>
<i>My whole body!</i>

16:42.650 --> 16:45.780
<i>I'm thirsty. And I need food...</i>

16:45.780 --> 16:47.740
<i>...to replenish my blood.</i>

16:50.740 --> 16:55.370
<i>I was fighting the old man,</i>
<i>then that bird guy appeared...</i>

16:55.830 --> 16:58.210
<i>The Monster Association...</i>
<i>They get on my nerves.</i>

16:59.040 --> 17:00.370
<i>What happened to the old man?</i>

17:00.750 --> 17:02.330
<i>He was fighting that centipede...</i>

17:03.250 --> 17:04.340
<i>Oh well, who cares...</i>

17:05.090 --> 17:08.090
<i>The smell of blood permeates</i>
<i>the stagnant air.</i>

17:08.470 --> 17:09.430
<i>Makes me wanna puke.</i>

17:09.880 --> 17:12.430
<i>And it's so quiet,</i>
<i>my ears are ringing.</i>

17:12.720 --> 17:14.560
<i>Am I deep underground?</i>

17:14.560 --> 17:15.640
<i>Who cares...</i>

17:18.850 --> 17:21.270
Please have mercy!
We were wrong!

17:21.310 --> 17:23.730
We'll never defy you ever again!

17:23.860 --> 17:26.150
Noo, I don't want to die!

17:26.230 --> 17:30.610
But you took out
two of my soldiers.

17:30.700 --> 17:33.280
I can't just let you
walk out of here.

17:33.700 --> 17:37.450
Your employer equipped you
with powerful gear

17:37.450 --> 17:39.250
so you'd better fight till the end.

17:39.540 --> 17:44.380
Everyone here just loves turning anyone
who resists into a plaything.

17:44.840 --> 17:47.500
Grr...
It's all his fault.

17:47.760 --> 17:50.670
Dammit. If that freak robot
hadn't shown up

17:50.670 --> 17:52.380
we could've escaped to the surface.

17:52.630 --> 17:54.550
Looks like the advertising worked.

17:54.800 --> 17:56.390
Thanks for the gift.

17:56.510 --> 17:59.520
I'm glad a capable
new recruit came to us.

17:59.600 --> 18:01.390
You pass with flying colors.

18:01.560 --> 18:03.940
What is your name, newbie?

18:04.440 --> 18:06.230
I am Machine God G5.

18:06.230 --> 18:06.650
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MACHINE GOD G5

18:06.650 --> 18:10.740
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
MACHINE GOD G5
I was deployed by the organization
to aid the Monster Association.

18:10.940 --> 18:12.070
"Organization"?

18:12.280 --> 18:14.990
How did you get to this hideout
without getting lost?

18:15.070 --> 18:16.740
Can I talk to your creator?

18:17.950 --> 18:19.830
So be it.
In any case, we welcome you.

18:19.870 --> 18:21.460
Besides,
we have another arrival anyway.

18:21.830 --> 18:24.960
<i>Stay hidden</i>
<i>and wait a little longer, Garou.</i>

18:25.790 --> 18:29.000
<i>A voice directly in my head!</i>
<i>Is it telepathy?</i>

18:29.130 --> 18:32.800
Having fought them myself,
I can say that

18:32.800 --> 18:36.180
their battle suits have
extremely high combat capabilities

18:36.180 --> 18:37.720
and are highly valuable.

18:38.310 --> 18:41.310
However, they appear to be
customized for each individual.

18:41.520 --> 18:45.440
So no one else, let alone a monster,
would be able to use them.

18:45.850 --> 18:49.610
In other words, we should let them
live and use them as pawns.

18:51.190 --> 18:54.860
Then, you're mine.
I'll train you well.

18:56.450 --> 18:57.910
Train?
What on earth?

18:57.990 --> 18:59.450
Please just let us go!

19:00.160 --> 19:01.200
Quiet!

19:07.460 --> 19:13.130
Excellent! I'm lucky to
have such promising slaves!

19:23.430 --> 19:26.060
Hey, Garou. You're up early.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.940
- So that's the Hero Hunter.
- He got rescued...

19:27.940 --> 19:29.820
- I like him.
- ...and treated for his injuries.

19:29.820 --> 19:32.820
Why did Gyoro-Gyoro
take interest in a mere human?

19:32.900 --> 19:35.070
- Is he human? A monster?
- Silence!

19:35.450 --> 19:37.700
I'm going to have an important talk
with him now.

19:38.200 --> 19:40.410
<i>What the heck is that giant</i>
<i>in the back?</i>

19:41.290 --> 19:42.870
What do you want me to do?

19:43.200 --> 19:47.080
After the recent battle,
there are fewer than 30 remaining

19:47.080 --> 19:49.750
threat-level Demon or higher
monsters left.

19:50.250 --> 19:53.010
Even so,
we are still strong enough to win.

19:53.380 --> 19:57.890
But what we lack right now
is unity...and a leader.

19:58.470 --> 20:02.220
I'd like you to become a member
of the leadership and assist me.

20:02.720 --> 20:04.220
A leader already?

20:04.350 --> 20:05.640
That's a pretty sweet deal.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.520
I was looking for someone

20:07.520 --> 20:12.150
with a strong anti-hero ideology
like him.

20:12.570 --> 20:15.740
He's a lone wolf,
but even if he is battered

20:15.740 --> 20:18.860
the way he goes for the jugular
against Class-S heroes

20:18.860 --> 20:20.070
is truly praiseworthy.

20:21.410 --> 20:24.830
However, our boss, Lord Orochi,
has one condition.

20:25.370 --> 20:29.040
Prove that you are a true monster.

20:29.210 --> 20:30.750
You want me to grow a horn?

20:30.830 --> 20:32.380
You have one day.

20:32.670 --> 20:35.880
I don't care who it is.
Bring me the head of a hero.

20:36.470 --> 20:37.880
If it's a hero's life you want...

20:38.090 --> 20:39.760
Hate to give you the bad news

20:39.760 --> 20:42.140
but Silverfang and his buddies
are alive.

20:42.260 --> 20:44.180
Centichoro was defeated.

20:48.600 --> 20:52.310
Sorry to bother you.
I have a favor to ask you.

20:52.480 --> 20:53.190
Hmph, what do you want?

20:53.190 --> 20:54.570
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
INSECT GOD
Hmph, what do you want?

20:54.730 --> 20:55.360
I want so badly to hear
a human scream.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.940
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER
I want so badly to hear
a human scream.

20:56.940 --> 20:57.070
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER

20:57.070 --> 21:00.320
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
KING THE RIPPER
I'm about to lose my mind.
Hurry up.

21:00.700 --> 21:02.490
Garou went outside.

21:03.490 --> 21:04.660
Follow him.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.710
Yesterday, it was Goketsu.

22:38.710 --> 22:41.210
And today, Centichoro was defeated.

22:41.420 --> 22:44.550
Yeah, I bet even Gyoro-Gyoro
didn't expect two top monsters

22:44.550 --> 22:46.550
to go down
before the decisive battle.

22:46.680 --> 22:49.060
Is that why he's trying to recruit
the Hero Hunter?

22:49.060 --> 22:50.680
So he can be
one of the key warriors?

22:50.890 --> 22:53.020
I can't read Gyoro-Gyoro.

22:53.190 --> 22:55.270
Not like I'm interested
or anything.

22:55.600 --> 22:57.770
As long as I can destroy
the Hero Association and Flash

22:57.770 --> 22:58.610
I'm all good.

22:59.150 --> 23:00.150
We recruited

23:00.150 --> 23:02.400
Speed-o'-Sound Sonic
but what happened to him?

23:02.740 --> 23:04.030
I haven't seen him around.

23:04.240 --> 23:06.450
Maybe he couldn't adapt
to the monster cells.

23:10.740 --> 23:14.500
I suffered all night,
but I think the worst is over.

23:15.040 --> 23:17.210
I hate those bastards from
the Monster Association.

23:17.210 --> 23:19.540
No one told me my stomach
would get this upset.

23:19.710 --> 23:21.130
I'll pay 'em back for this one day.

23:23.300 --> 23:24.260
Whatever.

23:24.630 --> 23:27.550
I never had any intention of
teaming up with the monsters.

23:27.590 --> 23:30.140
I just wanted to
take advantage of them.

23:30.180 --> 23:32.810
My only target is Saitama.

23:33.230 --> 23:34.390
That being said...

23:34.390 --> 23:36.940
I can feel it...a new power.

23:37.520 --> 23:40.230
My body is definitely changing.

23:40.610 --> 23:42.480
My body feels light.

23:42.570 --> 23:45.110
It may take a while
to get used to it.

23:45.570 --> 23:47.200
<i>So this is monsterization?</i>

23:47.320 --> 23:49.910
<i>Not that it's anything special.</i>

23:50.910 --> 23:55.910
SONIC LOST TWO KILOGRAMS

23:55.910 --> 24:00.770
MONSTER TRAITS
